WEBVTT

00:00:01.171 --> 00:00:05.001
What could be the cause of the
massive mosquito outbreak this year?

00:00:05.001 --> 00:00:09.381
We ask Mr. Kafetch, a mosquito expert who has published several books on the subject.

00:00:09.381 --> 00:00:11.631
Thank you for having me.

00:00:11.631 --> 00:00:13.641
Well, let me get right to the point.

00:00:13.641 --> 00:00:17.101
These mosquitoes belong to an entirely new species.

00:00:17.101 --> 00:00:18.731
Thus, I know nothing about them.

00:00:18.731 --> 00:00:19.561
Get out!

00:00:19.561 --> 00:00:22.931
Mass
Mosquito
Outbreak

00:00:19.561 --> 00:00:24.941
What could the cause be?

00:00:19.561 --> 00:00:24.941
Abnormal Mosquito Outbreak

00:00:19.561 --> 00:00:26.441
Attention: If you encounter a swarm of mosquitoes, flee immediately.

00:00:20.691 --> 00:00:22.061
My apologies.

00:00:21.681 --> 00:00:23.181
Mosquito's estimated course of advancement

00:00:21.681 --> 00:00:23.311
9pm

00:00:21.681 --> 00:00:23.431
6pm

00:00:21.681 --> 00:00:24.691
12pm

00:00:21.681 --> 00:00:24.941
Provided by the Hero Association

00:00:22.061 --> 00:00:26.441
Now, let's take a look at the areas
likely to be hit hardest by the outbreak.

00:00:23.351 --> 00:00:25.941
Man, City Z's in their path.

00:00:24.691 --> 00:00:26.441
Mass
Mosquito
Outbreak

00:00:24.811 --> 00:00:26.441
Mosquito's estimated course of advancement

00:00:25.441 --> 00:00:26.441
9pm

00:00:25.441 --> 00:00:26.441
6pm

00:00:25.561 --> 00:00:26.441
Provided by the Hero Association

00:00:25.691 --> 00:00:26.441
What could the cause be?

00:00:25.691 --> 00:00:26.441
Abnormal Mosquito Outbreak

00:00:25.811 --> 00:00:26.441
12pm

00:00:26.441 --> 00:00:29.441
Now we've got a mosquito outbreak? What's next?

00:00:31.071 --> 00:00:34.071
We interrupt this program for breaking news.

00:00:34.071 --> 00:00:37.161
A large swarm of mosquitoes has been sighted in City Z.

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:42.951
Mass
Mosquito
Outbreak

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:42.951
Cow barn inside the city

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:42.951
Attention: If you encounter a swarm of mosquitoes, flee immediately.

00:00:37.161 --> 00:00:40.871
Mummified carcasses of attacked
livestock have also been found.

00:00:40.871 --> 00:00:45.001
If you encounter a swarm of mosquitoes, flee immediately.

00:01:36.341 --> 00:01:39.721
This is an emergency evacuation warning.

00:01:39.721 --> 00:01:42.681
Threat level: Demon.

00:01:42.681 --> 00:01:48.231
No resident is to go outside under any circumstances.

00:01:48.231 --> 00:01:55.531
I repeat, no City Z resident is to go outside…

00:01:52.941 --> 00:01:54.531
Target acquired.

00:01:55.531 --> 00:02:00.031
THE LONE CYBORG

00:02:09.371 --> 00:02:13.121
ONE PUNCH

00:02:16.831 --> 00:02:18.581
THREE, TWO, ONE, KILL SHOT

00:02:18.581 --> 00:02:22.341
JOIN THE FIGHT, CERTAIN VICTORY, THE STRONGEST EVER

00:02:18.581 --> 00:02:22.341
SANJOU, HISSHOU, SHIJOU SAIKYOU

00:02:22.341 --> 00:02:24.341
WHAT WAS THAT? FRUSTRATION

00:02:22.341 --> 00:02:24.341
NAN DATTEN DA? FRUSTRATION

00:02:24.341 --> 00:02:25.841
THERE'S NO STOPPING ME

00:02:24.341 --> 00:02:25.841
ORE WA TOMARANAI

00:02:25.841 --> 00:02:29.971
ONE PUNCH, IT'S OVER, VICTORY AFTER VICTORY

00:02:25.841 --> 00:02:29.971
ONE PUNCH, KANRYOU, RENSENRENSHOU

00:02:29.971 --> 00:02:33.601
I WIN, I ALWAYS WIN, OVERWHELMINGLY

00:02:29.971 --> 00:02:33.601
ORE WA KATSU, TSUNE NI KATSU, ASSHOU

00:02:33.601 --> 00:02:37.441
POWER, GET POWER

00:02:37.441 --> 00:02:40.401
RIGHT TO THE VERY LIMIT

00:02:37.441 --> 00:02:40.401
GIRIGIRI GENKAI MADE

00:02:40.401 --> 00:02:41.611
HERO

00:02:41.611 --> 00:02:44.781
PEOPLE SHOWER ME WITH PRAISE

00:02:41.611 --> 00:02:44.781
ORE O TATAERU KOE YA

00:02:44.781 --> 00:02:47.821
BUT I DON'T DO THIS FOR THE FAME

00:02:44.781 --> 00:02:47.821
KASSAI NANTE HOSHIKU WA NAI SA

00:02:47.821 --> 00:02:49.071
HERO

00:02:49.071 --> 00:02:53.831
SO I JUST FIGHT EVIL IN SECRET

00:02:49.071 --> 00:02:53.831
DAKARA HITOSHIREZU AKU TO TATAKAU

00:02:53.831 --> 00:02:55.291
(NOBODY KNOWS WHO HE IS)

00:02:55.291 --> 00:02:59.461
COUNTLESS ENEMIES FILL THE SKY

00:02:55.291 --> 00:02:59.461
SORA OOI OSHIYOSERU TEKI

00:02:59.461 --> 00:03:02.541
BUT I WON'T TURN MY BACK AND FLEE

00:02:59.461 --> 00:03:02.541
ORE WA SE WO MUKE WA SHINAI

00:03:02.541 --> 00:03:03.881
HERO

00:03:03.881 --> 00:03:08.881
I'VE MADE UP MY MIND AND I WON'T GIVE IN

00:03:03.881 --> 00:03:08.881
NARABA YURUGINAKI KAKUGO SHITA TAME

00:03:08.881 --> 00:03:16.101
A FIGHTING HERO

00:03:08.881 --> 00:03:16.101
TATAKAU HERO

00:03:16.101 --> 00:03:22.651
A SOLITARY HERO

00:03:16.101 --> 00:03:22.651
KODOKU NA HERO

00:03:22.651 --> 00:03:27.651
I WANNA BE THE STRONGEST HERO

00:03:22.651 --> 00:03:27.651
I WANNA BE A SAIKYOU HERO

00:03:34.381 --> 00:03:36.251
Thanks to that warning, they're all empty!

00:03:37.091 --> 00:03:40.091
As if anyone's gonna die from a mosquito bite!

00:03:41.641 --> 00:03:45.521
If I get all this, so what if I lose a little blood?

00:03:50.441 --> 00:03:51.561
Wind…?

00:03:57.861 --> 00:03:58.691
What the—?!

00:04:33.101 --> 00:04:36.811
Come on, you guys. That wasn't nearly enough.

00:04:37.361 --> 00:04:40.281
Go get some more for me!

00:04:41.201 --> 00:04:42.821
Target acquired.

00:04:48.701 --> 00:04:50.161
I see.

00:04:50.161 --> 00:04:54.421
You make them suck the blood,
then take it all for yourself.

00:04:55.041 --> 00:04:59.131
You must be controlling the mosquitoes
via some sort of signal.

00:04:59.481 --> 00:05:02.341
That would explain their mysterious behavior.

00:05:03.051 --> 00:05:05.011
So if I were to get rid of you, the leader,

00:05:05.601 --> 00:05:07.851
would the swarm also disperse?

00:05:09.681 --> 00:05:13.191
Our next meal is here. Go drain him dry.

00:05:18.941 --> 00:05:19.941
Incinerate.

00:05:30.161 --> 00:05:32.161
I am about to eliminate you.

00:05:32.161 --> 00:05:33.751
Stay right where you are.

00:05:38.591 --> 00:05:41.341
You, eliminate me?

00:05:42.841 --> 00:05:43.921
Go on and try!

00:05:49.261 --> 00:05:50.181
Gotcha.

00:05:58.771 --> 00:06:01.111
Damn mosquitoes!

00:06:28.471 --> 00:06:29.721
Incinerate.

00:06:41.941 --> 00:06:44.281
Maybe a leg next?

00:06:47.531 --> 00:06:48.281
Wait...

00:06:49.281 --> 00:06:50.621
Where are my legs?

00:07:01.121 --> 00:07:02.251
Futile.

00:07:05.171 --> 00:07:07.881
You cannot escape from me.

00:07:09.181 --> 00:07:10.761
What the hell is that guy?

00:07:11.721 --> 00:07:14.221
He's gonna get me if I don't do something.

00:07:16.181 --> 00:07:18.891
The townspeople may all be hiding,

00:07:19.651 --> 00:07:22.231
but there are plenty of animals around.

00:07:23.321 --> 00:07:26.781
Come here, little ones.

00:07:26.781 --> 00:07:30.491
Empty all your stored juices into me!

00:07:35.951 --> 00:07:37.201
So many.

00:07:37.201 --> 00:07:42.081
If she's been collecting blood
from the whole town and beyond,

00:07:42.081 --> 00:07:45.291
then it might be more than
just a food source for her.

00:07:46.381 --> 00:07:48.881
I should put an end to this as soon as possible.

00:07:48.881 --> 00:07:50.301
Get back here, dammit!

00:07:50.421 --> 00:07:54.551
Insect Killer

00:07:51.051 --> 00:07:54.551
You and I aren't done yet!

00:07:55.221 --> 00:07:56.261
What's with this guy?

00:07:57.221 --> 00:07:58.141
It's in my mouth!

00:07:58.891 --> 00:08:00.191
You little—!

00:08:00.191 --> 00:08:00.521
Huh?

00:08:01.351 --> 00:08:02.731
What's that squirming over there?

00:08:02.731 --> 00:08:04.021
Wha—? Mosquitoes?!

00:08:06.071 --> 00:08:07.361
You over there.

00:08:08.281 --> 00:08:09.571
Evacuate now.

00:08:09.571 --> 00:08:11.281
That swarm has a mind of its own.

00:08:11.781 --> 00:08:14.031
If it senses you, it will attack immediately.

00:08:15.201 --> 00:08:16.281
Seriously?

00:08:16.661 --> 00:08:18.451
That's bad. I gotta get—

00:08:52.491 --> 00:08:56.991
Since you could speak, I thought you would have
at least human-level intelligence.

00:08:57.621 --> 00:08:59.041
But you were just a bug.

00:09:00.001 --> 00:09:03.411
You brought all the mosquitoes together
into one easy-to-burn swarm.

00:09:04.421 --> 00:09:05.921
When I spotted you,

00:09:05.921 --> 00:09:10.631
I confirmed there were no
living beings within 500 meters,

00:09:10.631 --> 00:09:13.091
so I should have been free to fire away.

00:09:13.931 --> 00:09:15.391
Wait, that guy might have—

00:09:15.391 --> 00:09:18.801
Man, you saved me. You're amazing.

00:09:19.181 --> 00:09:22.311
What'd you do just now?
You totally made them bug out!

00:09:22.311 --> 00:09:23.561
Ba-dum-tsh.

00:09:25.391 --> 00:09:29.231
Oh, I was just trying to make a joke
about the mosquitoes being bugs, and…

00:09:33.651 --> 00:09:36.321
Imbecile!

00:09:36.911 --> 00:09:39.831
I no longer need those little ones.

00:09:40.371 --> 00:09:41.541
I mean,

00:09:47.421 --> 00:09:49.171
look…

00:09:49.171 --> 00:09:51.461
how strong I've become!

00:10:08.401 --> 00:10:12.191
Your punches can't even kill a little mosquito?

00:10:16.451 --> 00:10:18.031
Weakling!

00:10:18.031 --> 00:10:19.371
I see.

00:10:19.371 --> 00:10:24.251
The more blood she consumes,
the more powerful she becomes.

00:10:24.251 --> 00:10:26.791
I think I'll have your head next!

00:10:28.541 --> 00:10:30.841
I let my guard down.

00:10:30.841 --> 00:10:32.041
I have no chance of winning.

00:10:33.551 --> 00:10:36.801
All I can do is self-destruct.

00:10:37.841 --> 00:10:40.051
Forgive me, Doctor…

00:10:48.651 --> 00:10:51.361
Mosquitoes… suck!

00:10:54.441 --> 00:10:55.361
Hold on!

00:10:57.401 --> 00:10:58.991
Please tell me your name!

00:11:00.321 --> 00:11:02.491
Oh. It's Saitama.

00:11:03.371 --> 00:11:05.491
Please make me your apprentice.

00:11:05.491 --> 00:11:07.371
Oh, sure.

00:11:10.381 --> 00:11:10.961
Wha—?

00:11:29.191 --> 00:11:30.151
Master!

00:11:37.991 --> 00:11:39.361
You actually showed up.

00:11:40.071 --> 00:11:41.161
Uh…

00:11:41.161 --> 00:11:43.161
It's "Genos," Master Saitama.

00:11:43.951 --> 00:11:46.331
Could you start by not calling me "master"?

00:11:46.331 --> 00:11:46.871
Teacher!

00:11:46.871 --> 00:11:48.541
Not "teacher" either!

00:11:49.831 --> 00:11:52.581
Good things come

00:11:49.831 --> 00:11:52.581
to those who wait

00:11:51.211 --> 00:11:52.581
Go on home after your drink.

00:11:53.091 --> 00:11:55.051
I'm not looking for an apprentice.

00:11:55.051 --> 00:11:56.841
Hold on, you're back in one piece?

00:11:56.841 --> 00:12:01.221
Yes, my body is mostly mechanical.
As long as there are parts, repairs are quick.

00:12:01.591 --> 00:12:03.471
You're an odd one.

00:12:03.471 --> 00:12:06.271
What kind of parts do you use, Master?

00:12:06.271 --> 00:12:07.721
Don't use any.

00:12:08.121 --> 00:12:10.311
What about the skin-colored
armor on your head?

00:12:10.311 --> 00:12:11.481
Yeah, that's my skin.

00:12:11.481 --> 00:12:15.111
But that would mean you're bald
despite being so young.

00:12:15.111 --> 00:12:17.231
Yes, I'm bald! What's your problem?!

00:12:17.991 --> 00:12:21.031
Me? You'll listen to my problems?

00:12:21.701 --> 00:12:23.991
No thanks. I'm good.

00:12:24.831 --> 00:12:28.741
Actually, four years ago, when I was 15,
I was still a normal human being.

00:12:28.741 --> 00:12:31.121
Did you hear what I just said?

00:12:31.451 --> 00:12:33.631
Although we had to pinch pennies,

00:12:33.631 --> 00:12:37.881
my family and I lived a peaceful and fairly happy life.

00:12:38.231 --> 00:12:43.631
But one day, a crazed cyborg went
out of control and attacked our town.

00:12:44.011 --> 00:12:45.551
The insane cyborg…

00:12:45.551 --> 00:12:49.891
Most likely, a faulty upgrade
caused his brain to malfunction.

00:12:49.891 --> 00:12:52.481
He destroyed everything in sight.

00:12:52.481 --> 00:12:55.441
Parks, schools, buildings, my house…

00:12:55.441 --> 00:12:57.901
He even took my family's lives.

00:12:58.691 --> 00:13:00.481
Miraculously, I survived.

00:13:00.481 --> 00:13:05.661
However, I was but a helpless 15-year-old,
weary and alone in a ruined town.

00:13:05.661 --> 00:13:08.791
That's when Doctor Kuseno happened to pass through.

00:13:08.791 --> 00:13:13.751
Doctor Kuseno, a scientist for justice,
was on a mission to stop the destruction

00:13:13.751 --> 00:13:15.711
caused by the rampaging cyborg.

00:13:15.711 --> 00:13:20.761
I begged Doctor Kuseno to perform
augmentation surgery on my body.

00:13:20.761 --> 00:13:23.931
That's how I was reborn as a cyborg
who fights for justice.

00:13:23.931 --> 00:13:29.351
I promised Doctor Kuseno that one day
I would terminate the evil cyborg.

00:13:29.351 --> 00:13:29.871
I see—

00:13:29.871 --> 00:13:31.811
It's been four years since that day.

00:13:32.181 --> 00:13:37.271
I'm now 19, and I've been wandering from town to town, eliminating evil.

00:13:37.271 --> 00:13:40.481
I've destroyed countless monsters and criminal organizations.

00:13:40.481 --> 00:13:44.401
But I have been unable to find
any clues about the insane cyborg

00:13:44.401 --> 00:13:46.781
and have grown frustrated and restless.

00:13:46.781 --> 00:13:50.621
I find myself chasing a vision of that cyborg whenever I face my enemies.

00:13:51.041 --> 00:13:54.161
Then last week, when that
mosquito monster appeared,

00:13:54.161 --> 00:13:56.251
I let my concentration slip.

00:13:56.251 --> 00:13:59.551
I was convinced I could not lose to
anything but the rampaging cyborg,

00:13:59.551 --> 00:14:03.381
so I neglected to analyze the data on my opponent and rushed to confront her.

00:14:03.381 --> 00:14:04.721
The result, as you know,

00:14:04.721 --> 00:14:07.221
was that an opponent with
immense strength bested me.

00:14:07.221 --> 00:14:09.601
If you, Master Saitama, had not been in the area,

00:14:09.601 --> 00:14:11.391
I would have undoubtedly been destroyed.

00:14:11.391 --> 00:14:13.981
Master Saitama, you saved my life.

00:14:13.981 --> 00:14:18.561
I owe Doctor Kuseno my life,
but now I am also indebted to you.

00:14:18.561 --> 00:14:20.941
That debt weighs heavily on me.

00:14:20.941 --> 00:14:24.781
I must not die until I destroy that cyborg.

00:14:24.781 --> 00:14:25.571
And to do that,

00:14:25.571 --> 00:14:30.331
I must continue fighting evil as a righteous cyborg
until he appears before me one day.

00:14:30.331 --> 00:14:31.871
I need to get stronger.

00:14:31.871 --> 00:14:34.411
Last week, when I saw your attack,

00:14:34.411 --> 00:14:37.041
I knew I had to study under you
as your apprentice.

00:14:37.041 --> 00:14:39.421
If only I could be as strong as you, Master Saitama!

00:14:39.421 --> 00:14:41.881
I have an old enemy to defeat,

00:14:41.881 --> 00:14:43.671
and not just for my own sake.

00:14:43.671 --> 00:14:45.921
It's for my hometown,
and for Doctor Kuseno.

00:14:46.341 --> 00:14:48.221
I realize I am still inexperienced.

00:14:48.221 --> 00:14:52.351
But right now, I need enormous power
so I can eradicate the greatest of evils!

00:14:52.351 --> 00:14:53.391
Doctor Kuseno is—

00:14:53.391 --> 00:14:57.141
Enough, you idiot!
Keep it to twenty words or less!

00:14:59.101 --> 00:15:01.941
Mosquito Girl was defeated?

00:15:01.941 --> 00:15:03.981
With one strike, you say?

00:15:03.981 --> 00:15:07.611
Well, she was just a prototype, after all.

00:15:11.701 --> 00:15:13.451
Why is he naked?

00:15:13.451 --> 00:15:14.791
Unclear.

00:15:14.791 --> 00:15:15.621
No matter.

00:15:16.081 --> 00:15:18.791
He'll make an excellent specimen.

00:15:18.791 --> 00:15:22.171
We shall study his physiology,
by force if necessary.

00:15:22.921 --> 00:15:24.921
Send a messenger and invite him here,

00:15:25.421 --> 00:15:27.721
to our House of Evolution.

00:15:29.421 --> 00:15:32.301
Good things come

00:15:29.421 --> 00:15:32.301
to those who wait

00:15:30.011 --> 00:15:32.301
Master, here's the short version:

00:15:33.761 --> 00:15:37.641
Please teach me how to become strong like you.

00:15:40.021 --> 00:15:40.561
Genos…

00:15:40.561 --> 00:15:41.441
Yes!

00:15:42.401 --> 00:15:43.271
How old are you?

00:15:43.271 --> 00:15:44.781
Nineteen.

00:15:44.781 --> 00:15:46.241
So young…

00:15:46.241 --> 00:15:48.611
I'm sure you'll surpass me in no time.

00:15:48.611 --> 00:15:49.701
Do you mean that?

00:15:49.701 --> 00:15:54.451
I'm 25 now, but I was 22
the summer I started training.

00:15:55.911 --> 00:15:57.201
Sure, I'll teach you.

00:15:57.791 --> 00:16:00.831
But it won't be easy. Can you handle it?

00:16:03.291 --> 00:16:04.001
Yes, sir!

00:16:06.261 --> 00:16:08.091
Object approaching at high speed.

00:16:08.091 --> 00:16:08.591
It's here!

00:16:08.991 --> 00:16:09.471
What?

00:16:13.351 --> 00:16:14.601
My name is…

00:16:14.601 --> 00:16:15.051
Huh?

00:16:17.981 --> 00:16:19.601
Pay for my ceiling!

00:16:20.441 --> 00:16:21.441
So…

00:16:21.441 --> 00:16:22.441
Hm?

00:16:22.441 --> 00:16:25.861
It seems our advance agent, Kamakyuri, is down.

00:16:25.851 --> 00:16:31.491
Rear

00:16:26.181 --> 00:16:28.241
I can't sense him with my telepathy anymore.

00:16:28.241 --> 00:16:31.491
What? Wasn't he one of our stronger guys?

00:16:32.451 --> 00:16:33.861
There are two more outside.

00:16:33.861 --> 00:16:36.411
Master, leave them to me!

00:16:38.831 --> 00:16:40.661
Don't break people's ceilings!

00:16:40.661 --> 00:16:42.541
Oh, never mind.

00:16:42.851 --> 00:16:45.171
Can't you guys just use the door?

00:16:49.811 --> 00:16:50.721
Master!

00:16:50.721 --> 00:16:52.591
No, I'm fine.

00:16:53.511 --> 00:16:56.261
I feel kinda like… a bamboo shoot.

00:16:57.061 --> 00:16:58.971
Elevated energy levels detected.

00:17:02.851 --> 00:17:04.271
A cyborg?

00:17:05.561 --> 00:17:06.401
Could it be?

00:17:07.271 --> 00:17:09.531
You are not the target.

00:17:09.881 --> 00:17:11.531
What's going on? I can't see.

00:17:11.881 --> 00:17:13.281
You are in the way!

00:17:23.531 --> 00:17:26.171
I have a few questions for you.

00:17:33.181 --> 00:17:36.471
It would appear you're in
what they call a "tight spot."

00:17:36.471 --> 00:17:38.641
Well done, Ground Dragon!

00:17:39.471 --> 00:17:43.681
GROUND DRAGON

00:17:41.181 --> 00:17:43.681
It complicates things if they put up a fight.

00:17:44.321 --> 00:17:45.561
Master!

00:17:45.561 --> 00:17:47.351
You dare look away?

00:17:48.151 --> 00:17:49.611
Quite courageous!

00:18:08.291 --> 00:18:11.341
I am the fruit of the House of Evolution's science.

00:18:11.341 --> 00:18:13.671
I am Armored Gorilla.

00:18:13.671 --> 00:18:15.971
Your attacks have no effect.

00:18:16.341 --> 00:18:18.011
"The House of Evolution"?

00:18:18.341 --> 00:18:20.681
What business do they have with my master?

00:18:20.681 --> 00:18:22.891
It does not concern you.

00:18:22.891 --> 00:18:28.191
And it is our rule that any who oppose us
are eliminated without fail.

00:18:30.111 --> 00:18:33.231
I must destroy you.

00:18:37.991 --> 00:18:39.071
Hey, jackass!

00:18:39.451 --> 00:18:41.031
What's with that look?

00:18:44.871 --> 00:18:48.621
I kinda like it in here.
It's warm and cool at the same time.

00:18:49.671 --> 00:18:51.751
I'm tired, so could you get lost?

00:18:54.921 --> 00:18:57.931
Looks like I need to put you in your place.

00:18:57.931 --> 00:18:58.931
Listen up!

00:18:58.931 --> 00:19:01.261
I'm gonna slice your eyes out with these!

00:19:01.261 --> 00:19:03.431
Then we'll see if you resist!

00:19:03.811 --> 00:19:08.061
The Beast King never lets anyone off easy.

00:19:11.231 --> 00:19:13.441
Well, enough fooling around.

00:19:14.031 --> 00:19:16.571
If you wanna apologize, now's your chance.

00:19:17.071 --> 00:19:19.701
You guys smashed my ceiling!

00:19:22.331 --> 00:19:23.531
Fine.

00:19:23.881 --> 00:19:28.251
Then behold the true power of the Beast—

00:19:26.371 --> 00:19:28.251
Aw man…

00:19:28.251 --> 00:19:30.831
I got dirt in my special place.

00:19:30.831 --> 00:19:32.421
Hey, are you listening?

00:19:33.091 --> 00:19:34.671
Let me just shake this out.

00:19:36.971 --> 00:19:37.971
You done?

00:19:37.971 --> 00:19:38.841
One sec.

00:19:41.891 --> 00:19:42.431
I'm done.

00:19:43.431 --> 00:19:48.431
Then behold the true power of the Beast King!

00:19:50.441 --> 00:19:52.441
Lion Slash!

00:20:00.031 --> 00:20:01.031
You okay, Frog Man—

00:20:01.031 --> 00:20:02.861
Outta the way, pissants!

00:20:04.281 --> 00:20:06.371
Such is the law of the jungle!

00:20:06.371 --> 00:20:07.991
And you're next!

00:20:12.041 --> 00:20:13.631
Wait! Don't kill him yet!

00:20:13.621 --> 00:20:15.881
LION SLASH: METEOR POWER SHOWER!!

00:20:13.971 --> 00:20:15.881
Lion Slash: Meteor Power Shower!

00:20:32.191 --> 00:20:33.811
Consecutive…

00:20:34.191 --> 00:20:35.361
Normal Punches.

00:20:55.841 --> 00:20:57.711
N-No one told me he'd be that strong!

00:20:58.591 --> 00:21:01.381
We should retreat for now and regroup…

00:21:02.931 --> 00:21:04.011
Found you!

00:21:04.011 --> 00:21:07.511
You've gotta be kidding me!

00:21:26.701 --> 00:21:30.411
Answer me, or be eliminated.

00:21:30.411 --> 00:21:31.201
Your choice.

00:21:32.041 --> 00:21:33.661
It is you who will be eliminated.

00:21:34.331 --> 00:21:35.751
You fool.

00:21:35.751 --> 00:21:40.091
I am the third most powerful fighter
in the House of Evolution.

00:21:40.091 --> 00:21:41.511
At your power level,

00:21:41.511 --> 00:21:45.341
you will never beat the Beast King,
the second most powerful.

00:21:45.341 --> 00:21:47.511
You will be destroyed.

00:21:48.761 --> 00:21:50.181
You mean this guy?

00:21:50.811 --> 00:21:52.221
Apparently so.

00:21:57.691 --> 00:21:59.071
Look, I'm really sorry.

00:21:59.071 --> 00:22:00.981
I'll tell you everything. Just don't kill me!

00:22:01.531 --> 00:22:04.451
What the—? What happened to your robot voice?

00:22:04.451 --> 00:22:07.321
Sorry, I was just trying to sound cool.

00:22:10.621 --> 00:22:16.871
Hey, come back home soon

00:22:10.621 --> 00:22:16.871
nee hayaku kaette kite ne

00:22:24.171 --> 00:22:30.091
When my worries keep me awake under the crescent moon

00:22:24.171 --> 00:22:30.091
tameiki ga mikazuki wo yurasu yoru wa

00:22:30.091 --> 00:22:36.221
All I can do is close my eyes and think of you

00:22:30.091 --> 00:22:36.221
me wo tojite kimi no koto kangaete bakari

00:22:36.221 --> 00:22:39.271
I want to see you, I feel like crying

00:22:36.221 --> 00:22:39.271
aitai kibun nakitai kibun

00:22:39.271 --> 00:22:41.771
I feel so romantic

00:22:39.271 --> 00:22:41.771
romantikku na kibun

00:22:41.771 --> 00:22:48.321
I hope my feelings reach you

00:22:41.771 --> 00:22:48.321
todokete kono omoi

00:22:48.781 --> 00:22:57.081
I know so very well

00:22:48.781 --> 00:22:57.081
datte zutto shitteiru no

00:22:57.081 --> 00:23:02.291
how hard you always work

00:22:57.081 --> 00:23:02.291
ganbatteru koto takusan

00:23:04.001 --> 00:23:06.961
You're the one I love

00:23:04.001 --> 00:23:06.961
daisuki na hito ga

00:23:06.961 --> 00:23:10.091
You're so strong, yet still I worry

00:23:06.961 --> 00:23:10.091
tsuyokute shinpai

00:23:10.091 --> 00:23:16.061
Only I ever see your weakness

00:23:10.091 --> 00:23:16.061
watashi ni dake wa yowasa misete

00:23:16.061 --> 00:23:22.101
I'll find you before the stars

00:23:16.061 --> 00:23:22.101
hoshi yori saki ni mitsukete ageru

00:23:22.101 --> 00:23:27.941
Come right back home

00:23:22.101 --> 00:23:27.941
massugu kaette kite ne

00:23:27.941 --> 00:23:36.161
Hey, come back home soon

00:23:27.941 --> 00:23:36.161
nee hayaku kaette kite ne

00:23:40.671 --> 00:23:43.211
What do you mean? The hit team was wiped out?!

00:23:41.831 --> 00:23:43.211
It was inevitable.

00:23:43.671 --> 00:23:45.461
How did this happen?

00:23:43.671 --> 00:23:45.461
Wait, don't jump to conclusions yet.

00:23:44.001 --> 00:23:45.461
Confirm the data once more.

00:23:46.051 --> 00:23:48.511
Hurry! I said, hurry!

00:23:46.461 --> 00:23:47.841
It may be a mistake.

00:23:46.961 --> 00:23:47.841
That's not it.

00:23:48.511 --> 00:23:49.471
We should report first.

00:23:49.471 --> 00:23:50.301
I'll confirm.

00:23:50.301 --> 00:23:50.881
Be careful.

00:23:50.881 --> 00:23:52.091
Just what happened?

00:23:51.221 --> 00:23:52.931
What's all the commotion?

00:23:59.931 --> 00:24:19.951
NEXT
TIME

00:23:59.931 --> 00:24:19.951
THE
OBSESSIVE
SCIENTIST

00:24:00.831 --> 00:24:04.501
Okay, time for Mosquito Girl's episode preview!

00:24:04.501 --> 00:24:07.881
Next week's story will be about my birthplace.

00:24:07.881 --> 00:24:09.341
I was born—

00:24:09.341 --> 00:24:11.641
What?! Time's up already?!

00:24:11.641 --> 00:24:13.301
Oh, all right.

00:24:13.301 --> 00:24:15.381
Next time, on One Punch Man : Episode 3,

00:24:15.381 --> 00:24:16.931
"The Obsessive Scientist."

00:24:16.931 --> 00:24:19.951
Scientist, huh? Who could that be?
